---
/**
 * PRIVACY POLICY — plain-language and intentionally basic.
 * It describes how this site actually works today. If you add analytics,
 * a booking tool, a newsletter or anything else that collects information,
 * update this page (and the "Last updated" date) at the same time.
 * Consider having it reviewed by a professional if your situation changes.
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const updated = 'November 21, 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Small Town Chatter"
  description="How Small Town Chatter collects, uses and protects the information you share through the contact form or by email."
>
  <section class="page-hero privacy-hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy Policy</p>
      <h1 id="page-title">Your information, <span class="accent">handled with care.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Here’s a plain-language explanation of what information this website collects, why, and what I do with it.
      </p>
      <p class="fine">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section prose-wrap">
    <div class="container--narrow prose">
      <h2>Who I am</h2>
      <p>
        This website is run by {site.owner}, owner of {site.name}, a small business offering website design and
        photography in the Ottawa Valley, Ontario, Canada. If you have any questions about this policy or your information,
        email me at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What information I collect</h2>
      <p>When you send a message through the contact form, I receive the information you choose to provide:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name and email address</li>
        <li>Your business name, town or location, and event date (if you include them)</li>
        <li>The service you’re asking about and the message you write</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If you email me directly, I receive your email address and whatever you include in your message. I don’t ask for
        sensitive information through this website, so please don’t include things like payment details in the form.
      </p>

      <h2>How I use it</h2>
      <p>I use the information you send only to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Reply to your inquiry and answer your questions</li>
        <li>Prepare a quote or proposal you’ve asked for</li>
        <li>Keep a record of our conversation if we end up working together</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        I won’t sell, rent or trade your information, and I won’t add you to a mailing list or send you marketing messages
        without your permission.
      </p>

      <h2>How contact form messages are handled</h2>
      <p>
        This website is hosted on Netlify, and the contact form is processed by Netlify’s form-handling service. When you
        submit the form, Netlify receives and stores the submission and sends a notification to my email inbox (a Gmail
        account provided by Google). Netlify also uses automated spam filtering on form submissions. These service providers
        may store and process information outside of Canada. You can read more in
        <a href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/" rel="noopener">Netlify’s privacy policy</a> and
        <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google’s privacy policy</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>How long I keep it</h2>
      <p>
        I keep inquiries only as long as I reasonably need them to respond to you, provide any services we agree on and keep
        ordinary business records. After that, I delete them.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
      <p>
        This website doesn’t use advertising cookies, and it doesn’t currently use analytics or tracking tools. Like any
        website, the servers that deliver it (Netlify for the site, and Unsplash for some of the stock photographs) may
        automatically log basic technical information, such as your IP address and browser type, to deliver and secure
        their services.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask me at any time what information I have about you, ask me to correct it, or ask me to delete it. Just
        email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and I’ll take care of it.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If the way this website handles information changes, I’ll update this page and the “Last updated” date above.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .privacy-hero h1 {
    font-size: var(--step-4);
  }
  .prose-wrap {
    padding-top: 0;
  }
  .prose {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  .prose h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .prose p,
  .prose li {
    color: var(--charcoal);
  }
  .prose ul {
    margin: 0 0 1.1em;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.35rem;
  }
</style>
